Promote through the repository release policy, verify the correct POS asset on pos.dgfy.ph, enable the feature for the intended tenant/surface, monitor decision errors, and record the Back Office replacement/removal condition.
Production proof confirms the popup exists in the deployed artifact, the API decision is authorized and audited, and rollback can disable the UI without data loss.

