POS unit/contract suite: npm --prefix apps/dgfy-pos test -- --run packages/web-core/src/features/pos/hooks/__tests__/usePosHistoryVoidWorkflow.test.jsx packages/web-core/src/features/pos/__tests__/posTransactionHistory.behavior.test.jsx; adapt to the repository's Vitest path resolution if the runner rejects package paths.
